BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Our fragile planet: Managing Invasive Plants Around your Home
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T153000
UID:6a1205dda99bdd027d42a649@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the\nCity of Toronto Urban Forestry\nstaff for a presenta
 tion on invasive plants commonly found around homes in Toronto. Learn how 
 to identify these species\, understand their impact\, and how to manage th
 em. You’ll also get tips on supporting local biodiversity through enhanc
 ing native habitats. Perfect for gardeners\, homeowners\, and anyone inter
 ested in urban ecology.
LOCATION:Steeles\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1205dda99bdd027d42a649
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
